Metadata-Version: 2.1
Name: rqt
Version: 2.0.2
Summary: rqt is a Qt-based framework for GUI development for ROS. It consists of three parts/metapackages. rqt_common_plugins- ROS backend tools suite that can be used on/off of robot runtime. rqt_robot_plugins - Tools for interacting with robots during their runtime. rqt_gui - that enables multiple `rqt` widgets to be docked in a single window.
Author: Dirk Thomas, Dorian Scholz, Aaron Blasdel
Author-email: dthomas@osrfoundation.org
Maintainer: Dharini Dutia
Maintainer-email: dharini@openrobotics.org
License: BSD
Keywords: ROS
Classifier: Intended Audience :: Developers
Classifier: Programming Language :: Python
Classifier: Topic :: Software Development
Provides-Extra: test
